Subject: [PATCH 12/13] EXEC-MU-ACCOUNTS re-check round 2 (checker C2-WEB, the
 browser as attacker and user): failing tests of the verified findings

- W1: the Monitor shows a refusal's code (CAPABILITY_REQUIRED) instead of its words; every non-admin sign-in lands there
- W2: CAPABILITY_REQUIRED and LIMIT_REACHED carry one fixed sentence per code; the name, limit and wait stay in
